@startuml
title Mini App Entity Model

class MiniApp {
  **Primary Key**
  --
  + ID : ObjectID
  --
  **App Details**
  --
  + AppName : string
  + AppIcon : string
  + BannerImage : string
  + URL : string
  + AppType : constants.AppType
  + AppViewType : constants.AppViewType
  + Stage : constants.Stage
  --
  **Configuration**
  --
  + MerchantID : string
  + ProductCode : []types.ProductCode
  + Credential : types.CredentialInformation
  + CommissionGLAccount : string
  + IsEventMiniApp : bool
  + IsThreeClick : bool
  --
  **Status**
  --
  + Enabled : bool
  + IsDeleted : bool
  --
  **Timestamps**
  --
  + CreatedAt : time.Time
  + LastModifiedAt : time.Time
  + DeletedAt : time.Time
}

note right of MiniApp::Stage
  Development stage 
  (e.g., Dev, Prod)
end note

note bottom of MiniApp
  **Field Descriptions:**
  **AppName**: Name of the mini-application
  **MerchantID**: Associated merchant
  **ProductCode**: Related product codes
end note
@enduml
